'''Ben Tennyson''', referred to as '''No Watch Ben''' in scripts and model sheets,{{Refn|[[:File:No Watch Ben Name Proof.png]]|group = DJW}} is an alternate version of [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Tennyson]] who doesn't have an [[Omnitrix]].

==Appearance==
No Watch Ben looks identical to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben Prime]]. The only discernible difference is his hoodie, which is similar to the one Ben Prime sometimes wears except without the "10" on the chest.

He used to have an old, brown wristwatch in place of the Omnitrix, before it was stolen by his timeline's version of [[Kevin Levin (No Watch Timeline)|Kevin Levin]].

